Find the claimant's stated purpose, approved trip dates, attendance, included services and explicit allocation evidence for this exact charge. Distinguish a merchant's product description from proof of business use. Preserve contradictory facts and exact evidence identities. Exclude unrelated personal records; absence of purpose evidence is a targeted question, not a moral inference.
